OL,3,AUS citizen Stephen Hubbard freed by
OL,4,ARussia as Trump envoy meets Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has released a 74-year-old
OL,7,FAmerican citizen who was jailed for
OL,8,Fallegedly fighting on behalf of
OL,9,FUkraine, as President Vladimir Putin
OL,10,Fmet US envoy Steve Witkoff in St
OL,11,FPetersburg for talks.
OL,13,FStephen Hubbard has been taken to
OL,14,FPulkovo Airport, Putin said during the
OL,15,Fmeeting early on Wednesday, according
OL,16,Fto Russian state media.
OL,18,FPresident Donald Trump later said the
OL,19,Fformer teacher was "on his way back
OL,20,Fhome" and "there was no 'swap'
OL,21,Fnecessary".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
