OL,3,AUS citizen Stephen Hubbard freed by
OL,4,ARussia as Trump envoy meets Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FHubbard was sentenced to almost seven
OL,7,Fyears in a penal colony in 2024. He was
OL,8,Faccused of serving in a defence unit in
OL,9,FIzyum when he was captured by Russian
OL,10,Fforces shortly after Moscow's
OL,11,Ffull-scale invasion in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
